        <item>
            <title>3.5.6</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 17:17:18 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.5.6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.5.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Fixed Codex App-style active sessions lingering in the notch after they go inactive.
- Provider-session rows now expire from recent hook, tool, or operation activity instead of the long-lived host app process.

## 中文

- 修复 Codex App 类型会话空闲后仍长期停留在 notch 活跃列表的问题。
- provider-session 现在按最近 hook、工具或 operation 活动清理，不再仅因宿主 App 进程存活而保留。
]]></description>
